WEBVTT

00:12.544 --> 00:13.354
Ready?

00:13.354 --> 00:17.014
While they pump you full of lead,
I'll go kill the big boss.

00:17.014 --> 00:18.364
Hey, ace detective,

00:18.364 --> 00:20.844
how about a plan that gets <i>both</i> of us out alive?

00:20.844 --> 00:21.944
It'll be fine.

00:21.944 --> 00:25.974
Don't stress, I'll delete your search history.

00:25.974 --> 00:27.054
Hold up.

00:27.054 --> 00:28.224
Eh?

00:28.224 --> 00:29.074
You looked at it?

00:29.614 --> 00:32.144

You looked at my search history?

00:33.624 --> 00:37.604
I became Siesta's assistant,
fighting the world's evils by her side.

00:38.174 --> 00:43.194
We spent the next
three years on a beautiful journey.

00:45.374 --> 00:48.784
It's been a year since those
dizzying days came to an end.

00:49.374 --> 00:53.744
Now in my final year of high school,
I have fully submerged myself in

00:53.744 --> 00:57.374
the lukewarm water we call
"everyday life".

00:58.794 --> 01:00.174
Am I okay with that, you ask?

01:01.004 --> 01:01.854
Of course.

01:02.384 --> 01:04.834
This way, I'm not bothering anybody.

01:05.314 --> 01:10.394
That's just how it is,
since the detective is already dead.

01:13.024 --> 01:14.664
You're the ace detective?

01:17.324 --> 01:21.184
From the very moment you caught my eye

01:17.324 --> 01:21.184
kimi wo miteta ano hi kara

01:21.364 --> 01:29.304
It felt like everything would change

01:21.364 --> 01:29.304
subete ga kawaru you na ki ga shiteta

