01:37.534 --> 01:41.364
I dimly remember the outlines of a dream

01:37.534 --> 01:41.364
yume wo miteta ki ga shita

01:41.674 --> 01:47.084
Echoing with footsteps whose sound is now lost

01:41.674 --> 01:47.084
ima jaa mo kikoenai ashioto de

01:47.624 --> 01:51.344
Yet when I opened my eyes

01:47.624 --> 01:51.344
me wo akereba itsumo to

01:51.774 --> 01:56.774
You were missing, as always

01:51.774 --> 01:56.774
onaji tada hitori kitai shiteita

01:57.144 --> 02:00.994
You know, all those things I was unable to say

01:57.144 --> 02:00.994
nee, kimi ni ienakatta koto

02:01.244 --> 02:05.834
Have remained bottled up to this day

02:01.244 --> 02:05.834
ima mo tojikometeru

02:07.094 --> 02:09.334
My heart is still searching

02:07.094 --> 02:09.334
ano sekai de mitsuketa

02:09.474 --> 02:11.734
For that important thing

02:09.474 --> 02:11.734
taisetsu na nanika wo

02:11.994 --> 02:16.404
It discovered in that world.

02:11.994 --> 02:16.404
kono kokoro wa sagashimotometeru

02:16.684 --> 02:19.384
Hey, I want us to always smile together

02:16.684 --> 02:19.384
nee, zutto koko de kimi to

02:19.604 --> 02:22.034
So right here and now

02:19.604 --> 02:22.034
waratte irareru you ni

02:22.314 --> 02:25.824
I'll make you a promise

02:22.314 --> 02:25.824
yakusoku wo suru yo

02:27.464 --> 02:30.004
That will transcend time

02:27.464 --> 02:30.004
toki wo koete, ima

02:49.664 --> 02:54.244
I'm currently being threatened by
a girl I've never seen in my life.

02:51.204 --> 02:54.934
Episode 2

02:51.204 --> 02:54.934
Episode 2

02:51.204 --> 02:54.934
I Still Remember, and I Always Will

02:51.204 --> 02:54.934
I Still Remember, and I Always Will

02:55.304 --> 02:57.624
On top of that, I have no idea why.

02:58.044 --> 02:59.834
Come on, say something damn it.

03:00.664 --> 03:02.684
Are you Kimizuka Kimihiko,

03:02.684 --> 03:04.464
the great detective
I've been hearing about?

03:05.224 --> 03:06.884
Detective.

03:06.884 --> 03:08.864
It's been a while
since I heard that.

03:08.864 --> 03:10.434
Don't like it.

03:10.434 --> 03:11.444
You've got the wrong dude.

03:11.444 --> 03:12.344
Now if you'll excuse me...

03:12.604 --> 03:13.344
Hold it!

03:14.854 --> 03:19.834
Answer me properly, or else I'll grab
that thing dangling in your throat.

03:20.684 --> 03:22.854
You're Kimizuka Kimihiko, right?

03:24.314 --> 03:26.524
I told you to say something!

03:28.054 --> 03:30.034
Ew, you're the worst.

03:30.034 --> 03:34.494
Drooling all over my fingers,
you literally just met me.

03:34.874 --> 03:38.104
What the hell is going on?

03:38.104 --> 03:40.784
What did I do to deserve this?

03:40.784 --> 03:42.404
Oh, right.

03:42.404 --> 03:43.924
I got it.

03:49.374 --> 03:51.594
You needed a hug.

04:00.154 --> 04:01.514
Oh my god, no!

04:01.514 --> 04:03.734
What are you doing?!

04:04.064 --> 04:05.234
Aw, too bad.

04:05.754 --> 04:08.194
We could've gone a bit further.

04:08.194 --> 04:10.634
Your body's not something to play games with.

04:10.634 --> 04:13.154
And don't just let some rando
shove his face in your boobs.

04:17.944 --> 04:19.534
I'm Natsunagi Nagisa.

04:22.094 --> 04:24.604
Sure, just wash your hands first.

04:27.754 --> 04:30.844
I have a request for you.

04:32.764 --> 04:34.304
I'm trying to find somebody.

04:35.204 --> 04:38.144
You're the great detective, aren't you?

04:38.594 --> 04:40.724
Unfortunately, I am not.

04:40.724 --> 04:41.934
You're not?

04:45.604 --> 04:47.474
